令格殺信，吏卒格信時，射中上林苑門，宣下吏詆罪，以爲大逆，當族，自殺。而杜周任用。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0000"}],"source_term":"自殺","interpretation_note":"原文明示死亡、執行或自殺；各次回顧未另造死亡事件。未知公元年保持未知，後一歳、十餘年等相對時間保留原文待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m022-0274","start":274,"end":276,"surface":"減宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p022","chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m022-0277","start":277,"end":278,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p022","chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m023-0360","start":360,"end":362,"surface":"減宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p023","chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"減宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p038","chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p038","chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p038","chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0172","start":172,"end":173,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p038","chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0209","start":209,"end":210,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p038","chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kul